# Pin this project to the public npm registry.
#
# Rationale (build decision, 2026-09-21): the ambient ~/.npmrc points at a
# Momentive AWS CodeArtifact proxy whose token expired twice during the initial
# scaffold build, once mid-install. That produced a package-lock.json with mixed
# `resolved` URLs, which makes `npm ci` fail whenever the token is dead.
#
# This is a personal project with no dependency on internal packages, so pinning
# the public registry keeps `npm ci` reproducible on any machine and in CI with
# no AWS credentials required. Remove this file if the project ever needs to
# consume a private Momentive package.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
